        },
        {
          "word": "following",
          "start": 1798.949,
          "end": 1799.141,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "God's",
          "start": 1799.141,
          "end": 1799.334,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "law.",
          "start": 1799.334,
          "end": 1799.527,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, all those heavenly bodies, stars, sun, the moon, and so on. They are following God's law.",
