          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But the reason they're up there is because there's no room for them down here on the planet earth.",
      "start": 1805.778,
      "end": 1809.351,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
